What is the output of the following C++ code snippet?
int a = 5, b = 2;
float c = a / b;
cout << c;

What will be printed by the following pointer arithmetic in C++?
int arr[] = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50};
int *p = arr + 1;
cout << *(p + 2);

What is the output of the following C code snippet?
```c
int x = 5;
int y = ++x * 2;
printf("%d %d", x, y);
```

What is the output of the following C++ code snippet?
int a = 7, b = 2;
std::cout << a / b;

What is the output of the following recursive function call mystery(4)?
int mystery(int n) {
  if (n <= 1) return 1;
  return n * mystery(n - 1);
}

